<title>USA: Aristech Chemicals Corp sets $150 mln 144A notes.</title>
<headline>Aristech Chemicals Corp sets $150 mln 144A notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Aristech Chemicals Corp was priced on Wednesday in the private placement market via Merrill Lynch &amp; Co Inc, according to market sources.</p>
<p>BORROWER ARISTECH CHEMICALS CORP</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	 COUPON 6.875 PCT  MATURITY 11/15/2006</p>
<p>TYPE 144A NOTES    ISS PRICE 99.265  FIRST PAY DATE 05/15/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA3  YIELD 6.979 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB	 SPREAD 80 BP	CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
</text>
